---
title: DownStoppedPool · proposal
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> inspect : hack down
    inspect --> existing : [pool running]
    inspect --> receipt : runtime_not_running
    receipt --> classify : read host-side receipt
    state classify <<choice>>
    classify --> stopped : [retained, no owner, none owed]
    classify --> owed : [owner alive or work owed]
    classify --> stale : [receipt not retained]
    classify --> refused : [unreadable]
    stopped --> [*] : exit 0
    owed --> [*] : refuse, name recover
    stale --> [*] : refuse, name hack up
    refused --> [*] : refuse as today

    note right of stopped
        INV StoppedIsTrue:
        reported stopped only if
        retained, owner dead,
        nothing owed.
    end note
    note left of receipt
        INV NoEffectWithoutPool:
        only lock-free host reads;
        no runtime effect.
    end note

    class stopped ok
    class owed wait
    class stale wait
    class refused fail
